      "extraction_date": "2026-11-10",
      "extraction_method": "Story 11.6: last names refilled to 500 distinct with names of individual characters of Tolkien's books: hobbit family names and hobbit and Bree surnames, then single-word names from the wiki's book-character categories (The Silmarillion, The Lord of the Rings, The Hobbit, Unfinished Tales, The Children of Húrin, Beren and Lúthien, The Fall of Gondolin) and individual-only categories (Kings, Queens, Princesses, Ring-bearers, Loremasters, Seers, Elf-friends, Twins, Story-tellers, Inhabitants of Tol Eressëa and their canonical subcategories; Deaths in battle, Villains, Children and Forest-folk left out because they mix film and game characters), then given names of two-word book and hobbit characters, then canon names under a disambiguation (a regnal number, a parenthesis or an epithet removed: « Adrahil I », « Malbeth the Seer »), used as last names as the existing list does. No film, game or pre-canonical category. Tolkien Gateway (the source of the existing lists) refuses automated access, so this wiki was used instead"
    }
